001661                    ; SDB_LBA
001662                    ; Maps a block index within the file to an absolute SD card LBA.
001663                    ;
001664                    ; Input: R8: pointer to the block map
001665                    ; R9/R10: block index lo/hi
001666                    ; Output: Carry=1: R9/R10 = LBA lo/hi
001667                    ; Carry=0: the block cannot be mapped (use the FAT32 library)
001668                    ; R8 unchanged
